NAME

list - List directory contents

SYNOPSIS

    list [-l|--long] [-t] [--tree DEPTH] [path...]

DESCRIPTION

List directory contents.

OPTIONS

    -l, --long — Show one entry per line with native metadata.
    -t — Show a directory tree (maximum depth 16).
    --tree DEPTH — Show a directory tree to the selected depth.
    -h, --help — Show this help.

NOTES

Multiple operands are listed in operand order; failures do not skip later operands, and any failure produces a nonzero status.
Use -- before a path beginning with a hyphen. The previous -t DEPTH spelling remains accepted.

